        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CTO150SLVTEKSBR, Modern Wooden Door Pull in Teak</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom the <a href=\"/collections/wood-door-pulls\"><b>First Impressions Wooden Door Pull Collection</b></a>, this Contemporary Teak Door Handle combines the natural warmth of Teak with contemporary solid brass mounting brackets and end caps. Both the end caps and the brackets are available in a wide array of finishes and the pull comes standard in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. Teak is a hard, strong, and durable wood that is great for use on exterior doors because it is resistant to insects and warping--even when exposed directly to harsh weather. The Modern Wooden Door Pull in Teak is in its natural color and unstained. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/collections/wood-door-pulls\"><b>Wood Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Corteo Teak Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CTO150SLVSBR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262230\"><b>First Impressions CTO150SLVTEKSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CTO150018SLVTEKSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150024SLVTEKSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150036SLVTEKSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
